@startuml wt_setup_failover
title WT failover during setup or while idle
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
participant "Niso i" as N
participant "Boomlet i" as B
participant "Other four peers" as P
participant "Old WT" as Old
participant "Candidate WT" as C
participant "Bound SAR i" as S
participant "Iso and designated Boomletwo" as Backup

N -> Old: Pending WT-dependent setup request
... Silence threshold or explicit user decision ...
N -> B: Propose roster candidate

alt Parameter agreement incomplete
  B -> P: Complete consistent parameter agreement first
  P -> B: Five matching signed parameter fingerprints
  B -> B: Establish setup ID, immutable roster and genesis head
end

ref over B,C
  02_common_switch.puml
  Five reviews and frozen snapshots, candidate registration,
  required SAR finalization and obligation discharge, PREPARE and COMMIT.
  07_decision_recovery.puml handles an interrupted decision.
end ref

alt Final ABORT
  B -> B: Persist cancellation and unlock matching setup state
  B -> Old: Retry setup under the retained predecessor head
else Final ACTIVATE
  B -> B: Install candidate head and retain completed checkpoints
  alt PARAMETERS_AGREED
    C -> B: Candidate registration receipt
    B -> B: Verify local WT-ready prerequisite
    B -> P: Signed WT-ready checkpoint
    P -> B: Complete matching checkpoint collection
  else WT_READY
    B -> B: Verify retained SAR finalization receipt from candidate preparation
    B -> B: Complete own SAR-ready prerequisite
    B -> P: Signed SAR-ready checkpoint
    P -> B: Complete matching checkpoint collection
  else SAR_READY
    ref over B,Backup
      Finish base authorized encrypted Boomletwo backup.
      Preserve normal-key authorization, Iso checks and BackupDone.
    end ref
    B -> B: Verify local backup-ready prerequisite
    B -> P: Signed backup-ready checkpoint
    P -> B: Complete matching checkpoint collection
  else BACKUP_READY or partial final checkpoint delivery
    P -> B: Exact completed checkpoint evidence
    B -> B: Verify collection and finish local completion guards
  else Completed setup with no active withdrawal
    B -> B: Retain idle state and use candidate for next withdrawal
  end
  ref over B,Backup
    Complete any remaining setup checkpoints in order.
    01_setup_changes.puml shows the full setup progression.
  end ref
  Old -> B: Delayed predecessor-head response
  B -> B: Reject stale WT authority
end
@enduml
